{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39999","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:45.350242+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Description\n\nIn `jax/experimental/mosaic/gpu/dialect_lowering.py` in the `vector.multi_reduction` lowering, we see:\n```python\n  reduced_dim = src.layout.tiling.tile_dimension(op.reduction_dims[0])\n  if any(reduced_dim[d] for d in src.layout.partitioned_warp_dims):\n    # cross-warp reductions require scratch space.\n    ...\n  else:\n    scratch = None\n```\n`Tiling.tile_dimension` indexes the tiling, but `op.reduction_dims[0]` is an array axis. The two are not the same: a `TiledLayout`'s tiling applies to an array's **trailing** dimensions, so when an array's rank exceeds the layout's base tile rank, array axis `a` corresponds to tiling axis `a - untiled_rank`, where `untiled_rank = len(shape) - len(layout.base_tile_shape)`.\n\nCompare `FragmentedArray.reduce`, which decides whether the scratch is *needed*:\n\n```python\n    untiled_rank = len(self.shape) - len(layout.base_tile_shape)\n    tiled_axes = tuple(a - untiled_rank for a in axis if a >= untiled_rank)\n```\n\nSo for `(4, 128, 32)` reduced along axis 1, the caller inspects tiling axis 1 (the minor axis) while the reduction inspects tiling axis 0 (the rows). They disagree, the caller passes `scratch=None`, and the reduction raises `scratch must be provided when cross-warp reduction is required`.\n\nHere's some code that shows the error in practice:\n\n```python\nfrom jax.experimental.mosaic.gpu import fragmented_array as fa\n\nlayout = fa.WGMMA_LAYOUT\nwarp_dims = layout.partitioned_warp_dims\n\nfor shape, axis in (((128, 32), 0), ((4, 128, 32), 1)):\n  untiled_rank = len(shape) - len(layout.base_tile_shape)\n  as_is = layout.tiling.tile_dimension(axis)               # the lowering rule\n  rebased = layout.tiling.tile_dimension(axis - untiled_rank)  # reduce()\n  print(f'{shape}, reducing axis {axis} (untiled_rank={untiled_rank}):')\n  print(f'  lowering rule says scratch needed: {any(as_is[d] for d in warp_dims)}')\n  print(f'  reduce() needs scratch:            {any(rebased[d] for d in warp_dims)}')\n```\n\nWe get \n```\n(128, 32), reducing axis 0 (untiled_rank=0):\n  lowering rule says scratch needed: True\n  reduce() needs scratch:            True\n(4, 128, 32), reducing axis 1 (untiled_rank=1):\n  lowering rule says scratch needed: False\n  reduce() needs scratch:            True\n```\n\n\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\njax:    0.11.1.dev20260814+ce6cfc5c2b\njaxlib: 0.11.0\nnumpy:  2.5.1\npython: 3.13.5 (main, Jun 12 2025, 12:22:43) [Clang 20.1.4 ]\ndevice info: cpu-1, 1 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Darwin', release='23.5.0', version='Darwin Kernel Version 23.5.0: Wed May  1 20:14:59 PDT 2024; root:xnu-10063.121.3~5/RELEASE_ARM64_T8122', machine='arm64')","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39999/comments","created_at":"2026-08-14T18:19:45Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39999/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/39999","id":5154528166,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39999/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABMzvbpg","number":39999,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,